    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> , where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, be a hyperbola in the xy-plane whose conjugate axis&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;subtends an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at one of its vertices&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math>. Let the area of the triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;be&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>.</p><table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>LIST-I</td>\t\t\t<td>LIST-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A. The length of the conjugate axis of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>P.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B. The eccentricity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>Q. <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C. The distance between the foci of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>R. <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D. The length of the latus rectum of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>S.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>The correct option is:"
